{"seq":1,"slug":"advance-compensation-decision","title":"先行赔付资格判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/platform-advance-payout/advance-compensation-decision","wordCount":2765,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"先行赔付资格判定\">先行赔付资格判定</h1><p>先行赔付资格判定要回答的不是「买家有没有保障」，而是「<strong>平台愿不愿意在责任未定之前先把钱付出去</strong>」。这两个问题的输入完全不同：第一章的资格判定看的是订单属性、市场法规和商品品类；本判定看的是赔付金额、证据强度、买家信用与卖家风险这四类信号。一笔完全符合保障条件的订单，可能因为赔付金额过高或证据不足而不被允许先行赔付，转而进入标准争议流程。</p>\n<p>把这两类判定分开是本节最重要的架构主张。混在一起的后果是：当你想收紧垫付风险时，会不小心改动了法定保障的资格（法律风险）；当你调整保障范围时，会意外改变了垫付策略（资金风险）。它们在数据库里应该是两张表、两个服务，只有一处交集——赔付单同时引用保障资格 ID 和垫付决策 ID。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-先行赔付的三类触发场景\">核心概念：先行赔付的三类触发场景</h2><p>并非所有保障赔付都需要先行。按「责任是否显然」可以把触发场景分成三类，它们的垫付策略截然不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>责任清晰度</th>\n<th>是否需要买家举证</th>\n<th>建议垫付策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物流超时未送达</td>\n<td>高（轨迹客观）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>可全额自动垫付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正品鉴定未通过</td>\n<td>高（鉴定方出具结论）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>可全额自动垫付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品与描述不符</td>\n<td>低（主观判断）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>限额垫付，超限转人工</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家反悔退货</td>\n<td>中（理由明确但责任在买家）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>不退运费部分可垫付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家拒绝履行退货政策</td>\n<td>中（需核验卖家政策）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>限额垫付</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个分层的依据是「<strong>证据的客观性决定垫付的安全边际</strong>」。轨迹和鉴定结论是第三方客观信号，几乎不会被造假，因此垫付后追偿的成功率接近百分之百；而「商品与描述不符」高度依赖买家的举证与平台的主观判断，垫付后可能发现买家滥用，因此必须设限额。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么客观证据可以跳过定责\">为什么客观证据可以跳过定责</h3><p>物流超时与鉴定未通过这两类事件有一个共同特征：<strong>责任判定的结果几乎不依赖于任何一方的后续答辩</strong>。轨迹已经写在承运商系统里，鉴定结论已经由鉴定机构出具，卖家无论如何答辩都改变不了这两个事实。在这种情况下，「先定责再赔付」的等待纯粹是流程浪费，因此可以直接跳过。</p>\n<p>反过来，凡是<strong>卖家的答辩可能改变结论</strong>的事件，就不能跳过定责。典型例子是「商品与描述不符」：买家说收到的是仿品，卖家说买家调包了，此时责任判定依赖双方举证，必须先让卖家说话。这就解释了为什么这类事件只能限额垫付——限额是在「不等定责」的收益与「可能误判」的风险之间取的折中。</p>\n<h3 id=\"先行赔付与争议流程的并行\">先行赔付与争议流程的并行</h3><p>严格说先行赔付并不是跳过定责，而是<strong>让定责与赔付并行推进</strong>。买家拿到钱的同时，定责流程仍在后台运行，只是它的输出不再决定买家何时拿到钱，而只决定这笔钱最终由谁承担。这个视角很重要，因为它避免了把「先行赔付」误解成「免责赔付」——后者会让平台放弃追偿，最终不可持续。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[赔付事件] --&gt; S{责任是否显然?}&#10;  S --&gt;|客观证据| A[全额自动垫付]&#10;  S --&gt;|主观证据| L{金额 &lt;= 小额阈值?}&#10;  L --&gt;|是| B[限额自动垫付]&#10;  L --&gt;|否| C[转人工审核]&#10;  B --&gt; R[追偿流程]&#10;  A --&gt; R&#10;  C --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; D{定责结果}&#10;  D --&gt;|商家责任| E[向商家扣款]&#10;  D --&gt;|平台责任| F[计入平台成本]&#10;  D --&gt;|买家责任| G[追回已垫付款]\">graph TD\n  P[赔付事件] --&gt; S{责任是否显然?}\n  S --&gt;|客观证据| A[全额自动垫付]\n  S --&gt;|主观证据| L{金额 &lt;= 小额阈值?}\n  L --&gt;|是| B[限额自动垫付]\n  L --&gt;|否| C[转人工审核]\n  B --&gt; R[追偿流程]\n  A --&gt; R\n  C --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; D{定责结果}\n  D --&gt;|商家责任| E[向商家扣款]\n  D --&gt;|平台责任| F[计入平台成本]\n  D --&gt;|买家责任| G[追回已垫付款]</pre><h2 id=\"额度与阈值的决定因素\">额度与阈值的决定因素</h2><p>先行赔付的核心控制变量是<strong>自动垫付的金额上限</strong>。这个上限不是拍出来的，它应该由三个因素共同决定。</p>\n<p>第一个因素是<strong>单笔赔付额与追偿回收率的乘积</strong>，也就是预期损失。若某类赔付的追偿回收率是 90%，则即使全额垫付，预期损失只有 10%，可以放宽；若回收率只有 40%（例如卖家已关店跑路），则必须严格设限。</p>\n<p>第二个因素是<strong>买家的历史行为</strong>。一个从未发起过异常赔付的买家，其举证可信度高于一个近 90 天内有多次可疑赔付的买家。这不是歧视，而是与第四章的滥用防控共享同一个风险信号。</p>\n<p>第三个因素是<strong>卖家侧的余额状况</strong>。如果卖家账上还有足够的待结算款可供扣回，垫付风险就低；如果卖家已结算离场或余额不足，垫付就变成了平台的净损失。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE advance_payout_decision (&#10;  decision_id       BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  payout_id         BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  guarantee_elig_id BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount            NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency          CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  auto_approved     BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  limit_applied     NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_class    TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (evidence_class IN (&#39;objective&#39;,&#39;subjective&#39;)),&#10;  buyer_risk_band   TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  seller_balance    NUMERIC(14,2),&#10;  decided_at        TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_apd_pending_recovery&#10;  ON advance_payout_decision (payout_id)&#10;  WHERE auto_approved;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> advance_payout_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payout_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  guarantee_elig_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auto_approved     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  limit_applied     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_class    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (evidence_class </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'objective'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'subjective'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buyer_risk_band   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  seller_balance    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_apd_pending_recovery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> advance_payout_decision (payout_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auto_approved;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"上限的合成公式\">上限的合成公式</h3><p>自动垫付上限可以用一个可解释的公式表达，而不是一个黑箱模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>limit</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mtext>class</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>balance</mtext><mtext>seller</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mtext>buyer-credit</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{limit} = \\min\\bigl(\\text{cap}_{\\text{class}},\\ \\text{balance}_{\\text{seller}} \\times r_{\\text{recover}},\\ \\text{cap}_{\\text{buyer-credit}}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">limit</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">class</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">balance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyer-credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mtext>class</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}_{\\text{class}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">class</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按赔付类型设定的绝对上限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>balance</mtext><mtext>seller</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{balance}_{\\text{seller}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">balance</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是卖家可扣回余额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{recover}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该类型的追偿回收率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mtext>buyer-credit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}_{\\text{buyer-credit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8108em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">buyer-credit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是基于买家信用等级的上限。取三者最小值的原因很直接：任何一项都不能被突破，否则风险就从另一个方向漏出去。这个公式的好处是每一项都有明确的责任人——风控调整 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mtext>class</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}_{\\text{class}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">class</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，结算系统提供 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>balance</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{balance}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">balance</span></span></span></span></span></span>，数据团队维护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{recover}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"证据强度如何量化\">证据强度如何量化</h2><p>「客观证据」与「主观证据」的二分在实践中需要更细的刻度，否则大量处于中间地带的事件无法归类。一个可操作的量化方式是给每类证据一个分值，累加后映射到处理通道。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据来源</th>\n<th>分值</th>\n<th>可否被伪造</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承运商签收/异常轨迹</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>极难</td>\n<td>第三方系统直连</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>鉴定机构结论</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>极难</td>\n<td>有资质约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台内物流时间戳</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>难</td>\n<td>平台自有数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家上传的实物照片</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>容易</td>\n<td>需配合其他信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家文字描述</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>容易</td>\n<td>单独不足以定责</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家后台操作记录</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>难</td>\n<td>平台可审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>累加后按阈值分流：达到 4 分以上视为客观类，可走自动全额垫付；2 至 3 分走限额垫付；低于 2 分转人工。这套打分的价值在于它把「我觉得这个证据挺硬」变成了可审计的数值，且在争议复盘时能回答「当时为什么会自动通过」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"EVIDENCE_SCORE = {&#10;    &quot;carrier_tracking&quot;: 3, &quot;authentication_result&quot;: 3,&#10;    &quot;platform_logistics_ts&quot;: 2, &quot;seller_backoffice_log&quot;: 2,&#10;    &quot;buyer_photo&quot;: 1, &quot;buyer_text&quot;: 1,&#10;}&#10;COMBO_BONUS = {(&quot;buyer_photo&quot;, &quot;carrier_tracking&quot;): 1}  # 组合规则&#10;&#10;def classify(evidence_types, amount, seller_balance, recov_rate, cap_class, cap_buyer):&#10;    score = sum(EVIDENCE_SCORE[t] for t in evidence_types)&#10;    score += sum(b for pair, b in COMBO_BONUS.items() if set(pair) &lt;= set(evidence_types))&#10;    limit = min(cap_class, seller_balance * recov_rate, cap_buyer)&#10;    if score &gt;= 4 and amount &lt;= limit:&#10;        return &quot;auto_full&quot;&#10;    if score &gt;= 2 and amount &lt;= limit * 0.3:&#10;        return &quot;auto_capped&quot;&#10;    return &quot;manual_review&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EVIDENCE_SCORE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"carrier_tracking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"authentication_result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"platform_logistics_ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller_backoffice_log\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"buyer_photo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyer_text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COMBO_BONUS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyer_photo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"carrier_tracking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">): </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 组合规则</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(evidence_types, amount, seller_balance, recov_rate, cap_class, cap_buyer):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">EVIDENCE_SCORE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[t] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evidence_types)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pair, b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COMBO_BONUS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pair) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(evidence_types))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cap_class, seller_balance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recov_rate, cap_buyer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"auto_full\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"auto_capped\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"manual_review\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"打分的失效边界\">打分的失效边界</h3><p>需要明确打分的适用边界：它只在<strong>证据类型已知且来源可信</strong>时有效。如果买家上传的照片来自平台外部，其分值仍然按 1 计，但必须在数据里保留来源标记，否则第四章的欺诈识别会失去追溯依据。另一个边界是<strong>证据组合的乘性效应</strong>：单独一张照片是 1 分，但照片加上承运商轨迹显示的「包裹重量在运输途中变化」这个组合，其判断力远高于两个独立信号的简单相加，因此打分表必须允许定义少量组合规则，而不是纯粹线性累加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与争议流程的衔接\">与争议流程的衔接</h2><p>先行赔付不等于放弃争议流程。垫付发生后，事件仍然需要进入定责流程，只是买家侧的等待已经结束。</p>\n<p>这里有一个关键的状态设计：<strong>赔付单与争议单必须相互独立但可互查</strong>。赔付单记录「钱已付给买家」，争议单记录「责任还在判」。一笔垫付可能对应零个或多个争议单（例如买家同时就延迟和货不对板发起两件事），因此不能用一对一的字段把它们绑死。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; eligible: 保障资格成立&#10;  eligible --&gt; advanced: 垫付判定通过&#10;  eligible --&gt; standard: 判定不通过&#10;  advanced --&gt; recovering: 定责进行中&#10;  recovering --&gt; recovered: 商家责任, 扣款完成&#10;  recovering --&gt; platform_cost: 平台责任&#10;  recovering --&gt; clawback: 买家责任&#10;  clawback --&gt; recovered: 追回成功&#10;  clawback --&gt; written_off: 追回失败\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; eligible: 保障资格成立\n  eligible --&gt; advanced: 垫付判定通过\n  eligible --&gt; standard: 判定不通过\n  advanced --&gt; recovering: 定责进行中\n  recovering --&gt; recovered: 商家责任, 扣款完成\n  recovering --&gt; platform_cost: 平台责任\n  recovering --&gt; clawback: 买家责任\n  clawback --&gt; recovered: 追回成功\n  clawback --&gt; written_off: 追回失败</pre><h3 id=\"赔付不构成责任自认\">赔付不构成责任自认</h3><p>一个容易被忽略但法律上很重要的约束：<strong>赔付不应被视为平台承认责任</strong>。这一点必须在条款层面明确，否则每笔垫付都会在后续争议中变成对平台不利的自认。工程上的对应做法是让赔付记录与定责结论存放于不同的表、由不同的流程写入，且在对外文件中不把「已赔付」表述为「已认定」。这看起来是文案问题，实际上决定了平台在卖家诉讼中的举证地位。</p>\n<h3 id=\"平台保障与卡组织拒付的互斥\">平台保障与卡组织拒付的互斥</h3><p>eBay 的规则里有一个值得借鉴的设计：它的保障会因买家「通过另一种解决方式处理同一问题」而失效，例如就同一笔交易发起拒付（chargeback），这是在划清「平台保障」与「卡组织争议」两条不可以同时走的路径（<a href=\"https://www.ebay.com/help/policies/ebay-money-back-guarantee-policy/ebay-money-back-guarantee-policy?id=4210\">eBay MBG 政策</a>）。原因很实在：卡组织拒付会把资金从平台侧直接划走，若平台保障已经赔付过同一笔订单，平台就承担了两次损失。</p>\n<p>工程上这条互斥规则需要三重落实：<strong>资格判定的输入里包含「是否存在进行中的拒付」</strong>；<strong>赔付发生时向支付通道登记该订单已进入平台保障流程</strong>；<strong>拒付发生时查询并撤销尚未执行的赔付</strong>。第三重最难，因为两条流水线由不同团队维护，需要一个共享的订单级状态锁来协调。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件顺序</th>\n<th>正确处理</th>\n<th>错误处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先赔付，后拒付</td>\n<td>拒付发生时冻结/追回赔付</td>\n<td>两条通道各赔一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先拒付，后申请保障</td>\n<td>保障资格判定为不成立</td>\n<td>重复赔付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同时进行</td>\n<td>以先到者为准，另一条置为 superseded</td>\n<td>状态互锁、两边都挂起</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>先行赔付资格判定回答的是<strong>平台愿意承担多大垫付风险</strong>，与保障资格是两个独立的判定。</li>\n<li>触发场景按<strong>证据客观性</strong>分层：客观证据可全额自动垫付，主观证据须设限额。</li>\n<li>自动垫付上限取三者最小值：类型绝对上限、卖家可扣回余额 × 回收率、买家信用上限。</li>\n<li>证据强度用量化打分表建模，累加后映射到自动/限额/人工三条通道。</li>\n<li>赔付单与争议单相互独立，一笔垫付可对应多个争议单，不可一对一绑定。</li>\n<li>平台保障与卡组织拒付是<strong>互斥的救济通道</strong>，同时走会导致重复赔付。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>垫付判定完成后，钱流向哪、事后怎么收回，见 <a href=\"platform-advance-recover\">平台垫付与向商家追偿</a>。支撑这些垫付的资金池要多大才够，见 <a href=\"guarantee-fund-reserve\">保障资金池与准备金</a>。资格与保障产品本身见 <a href=\"../guarantee-product-catalog/guarantee-eligibility-market\">保障资格与按市场策略</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"先行赔付资格判定","id":"先行赔付资格判定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：先行赔付的三类触发场景","id":"核心概念-先行赔付的三类触发场景"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么客观证据可以跳过定责","id":"为什么客观证据可以跳过定责"},{"level":3,"text":"先行赔付与争议流程的并行","id":"先行赔付与争议流程的并行"},{"level":2,"text":"额度与阈值的决定因素","id":"额度与阈值的决定因素"},{"level":3,"text":"上限的合成公式","id":"上限的合成公式"},{"level":2,"text":"证据强度如何量化","id":"证据强度如何量化"},{"level":3,"text":"打分的失效边界","id":"打分的失效边界"},{"level":2,"text":"与争议流程的衔接","id":"与争议流程的衔接"},{"level":3,"text":"赔付不构成责任自认","id":"赔付不构成责任自认"},{"level":3,"text":"平台保障与卡组织拒付的互斥","id":"平台保障与卡组织拒付的互斥"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保障资格与按市场策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/guarantee-product-catalog/guarantee-eligibility-market"},"next":{"title":"平台垫付与向商家追偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/consumer-guarantee-promise-platform/platform-advance-payout/platform-advance-recover"}}